        <p>WARRINGTON. Play in the captain's medal competition took place on Saturday. Scores : FIRST DIVISION, Gross. !reap. Net. J E Bidles L Holden Bl ... pl 1 ... 82 A Knowles E Guest F Pendlebury 92 ... 7 ... 85 C H Unsworth SECOND GIVISION. Gross. IFc3p. Net. Fll Roberts 0 Lorthouse R T Fairclough B Fairclough Success of a Local Dog Fancier. At the Widnes and District Canine Society's Show held in the Borough Rink on Thursday, Mr. F. Townley, 441, Wellfield -street, Warrington, was successful in winning 4 firsts, 4 specials and reserve for the Cup and best dog in show with his famous Pug, Cute Jiggawug.</p>
